From bdc34dcebf0138432984a6463dda3376cf106af2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 16:38:01 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] sun60iw2: enable GMAC Ethernet and derive hardware MAC from
 SID eFuse

This patch enables the Synopsys DWC_ETH_QOS Gigabit Ethernet controller
on Allwinner A733 (sun60iw2) platforms such as the Orange Pi 4 Pro,
allowing full Gigabit networking, DHCP, and TFTP/PXE network boot in U-Boot.

Summary of changes:
1. Power Rail Management (AXP8191 PMIC):
   - Automatically enables PMIC regulators 'dc1sw1' (3.3V PHY power / 0_AVDD33)
     and 'dc1sw2' (3.3V GMAC I/O power / dwmac3v3) during GMAC probe and reset.

2. Clock Control & Active-Low Gating (GMAC 2.1.0):
   - Implements sunxi_dwmac210_set_syscon() for GMAC 2.1.0 variants.
   - Clears GMAC_CLK_GATE_CFG_REG (0x04508080) to 0x00000000. In the A733 GMAC
     hardware, these register bits use active-high clock gating (0 = clock active,
     1 = clock gated); writing 0x0 enables the CSR, RX, TX, PTP, and APP clocks.
   - Un-gates gmac0_axi and gmac1_axi peripheral clocks in clk-sun60iw2.c.
   - Writes the hardware protection unlock key (0x00040b02) to CCU GMAC_MBUS
     (0x020025E4) to enable DMA memory bus access.

3. PHY Reset & Pinmux:
   - Configures Port H (PH0..PH15) pinmux to function 5 (rgmii0).
   - Sequences active-low PHY hardware reset on PH16 (10ms assert, 150ms release)
     for the on-board Motorcomm YT8531 PHY (PHY ID 0x4F51E91B).

4. Deterministic Hardware MAC Address Generation:
   - Implements eqos_get_enetaddr_aw() callback in eqos_aw_ops.
   - Reads the unique 128-bit SoC SID eFuse registers at 0x03006200 and derives
     a permanent, deterministic MAC address using standard Allwinner CRC32
     hashing when 'ethaddr' is not explicitly set in the environment.
   - Eliminates random MAC address generation warnings and ensures static DHCP
     leases and PXE boot bindings function reliably across reboots.

5. Device Tree & Defconfig:
   - Enables the gmac0 node and pinmux definitions in sun60iw2p1-soc-system.dts.
   - Enables CONFIG_DWC_ETH_QOS_AW, CONFIG_CMD_MII, CONFIG_CMD_MDIO, and
     CONFIG_CMD_PING in sun60iw2p1_t736_defconfig.

Signed-off-by: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Assisted-by: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>
